// Naya — base de connaissances (en), générée depuis le manuel StarClip vérifié. Ne pas modifier à la main.
window.NAYA_KB = window.NAYA_KB || {};
window.NAYA_KB["en"] = {"langue":"en","version":"2026-10-19","sections":[{"c":"demarrer","t":"1. Getting started","r":null,"x":"### 1.1 StarClip in four steps\nThe app always follows the same order. Each panel changes only one thing, which is what makes results predictable.\n1. Your photo: the foundation, and the face the app will protect.\n2. The image: outfit, setting, pose, retouching.\n3. The video: script, several shots, lip-sync, format.\n4. Sharing: you download and publish.\n\nGolden rule: only move on to video once you really like the image.\n\n### 1.2 A short glossary for beginners\n Word What it means \n --- --- \n Prompt The text where you describe what you want. The engine reads it to create your video or song. \n Engine The artificial intelligence program that produces the result (Seedance, Aleph…). Each engine has its strengths. \n Generation A creation you start. A paid generation is charged to your balance at the moment you start it. \n Premium balance The money you topped up, in FCFA. Premium tools are paid from it, per use. \n StarClip credits The videos included in a classic pack. Not the same thing as the Premium balance. \n Reference An image, video or sound you give the engine as inspiration (face, outfit, setting, song). \n Resolution How sharp the image is: 480p (test), 720p (good), 1080p (high definition). \n Format (ratio) The shape of the image: 9:16 vertical (TikTok, status), 16:9 horizontal (YouTube), 1:1 square. \n Stems The separate tracks of a song: vocals, drums, bass, other instruments. \n Moderation The provider's automatic check, which can refuse certain images or texts. \n\n### 1.3 Your StarClip code and your balance\n- You receive your code on WhatsApp after paying with Orange Money or MTN MoMo. Type it at the top of the app and confirm: the green line shows what you have left.\n- One code works on several devices. Keep it safe: it carries your credits and your balance.\n- Your Premium balance appears at the top of the 👑 tab as soon as your code is validated.\n\n### 1.4 Topping up: Premium packs ✅\n Pack You pay Balance received \n --- --- --- \n Découverte 10,499 FCFA 10,499 FCFA \n Créateur 24,999 FCFA 27,499 FCFA (+10%) \n Studio 49,999 FCFA 57,499 FCFA (+15%) \n Free amount from 1,499 FCFA the same amount \n\nOrder on WhatsApp from the « 💳 Commander » (Order) page. No subscription is needed: you pay for each creation individually, from your balance.\n\n### 1.5 The 👑 Premium tab: how it works ✅\nDespite its name, the coloured 👑 Admin Premium 5.0 tab is for clients: it opens the studio's professional engines. Each engine is a tile; tap it to open it. On a computer, settings are on the left and the result on the right.\n\nElements common to all tiles 📸:\n Element Role \n --- --- \n ← Tous les moteurs (All engines) Back to the list of tiles. \n Engine name and price (top right) The price updates with the chosen option. For Aleph, it appears after you choose the video. \n Duration chips (e.g. « 5 s · 3 499 FCFA ») Choose the duration or length. \n 📂 button Choose the photo, video or audio on your device. \n Text box Describe what you want. \n Start button It shows what is missing (« Entre d'abord ton code StarClip en haut de la page » — enter your StarClip code at the top first; « Choisis d'abord une photo » — choose a photo first; « Décris ta scène » — describe your scene…). When everything is ready, it becomes « 👑 Lancer — price » (Start). \n Result (right) Progress circle (percentage, timer, step), then your result. \n\n⚠️ For Seedance 2.5, Aleph and Multi-Shot, a refusal by the engine during creation is not refunded; the app reminds you below the button. If the engine refuses before starting, your balance is not charged. If a paid generation fails for a technical reason, your credits are refunded automatically."},{"c":"aleph","t":"2. Aleph 2.0 ✅","r":0,"x":""},{"c":"aleph","t":"2. Aleph 2.0 ✅","r":1,"x":"1. Overview and purpose. Aleph edits a video you already have, without redoing everything: change the setting, remove an element. The dance, framing and people stay."},{"c":"aleph","t":"2. Aleph 2.0 ✅","r":2,"x":"2. Access. 👑 tab → 🎞️ Aleph 2.0 tile."},{"c":"aleph","t":"2. Aleph 2.0 ✅","r":3,"x":"3. Buttons and fields 📸\n Element Role \n --- --- \n 📂 Choisir la vidéo à modifier (Choose the video to edit) Imports your video. The app reads its length (« ⏳ Lecture de la durée… »). \n Price « Choisis d'abord ta vidéo » (choose your video first), then the price for the length read. \n Ce que tu veux changer (What you want to change) Describe the change; state what must stay identical. \n Start « Choisis d'abord la vidéo à modifier », then « 👑 Lancer — price »."},{"c":"aleph","t":"2. Aleph 2.0 ✅","r":4,"x":"4. Accepted files. A video from your device, 10 s maximum on the client side. Beyond that, the app shows: « Cette vidéo fait … s — Aleph Premium accepte jusqu'à 10 s. Coupe-la puis réessaie. » (trim it, then try again)."},{"c":"aleph","t":"2. Aleph 2.0 ✅","r":5,"x":"5. Tutorial\n1. Trim your video to 10 s maximum if needed.\n2. Tap 📂 Choisir la vidéo à modifier and wait for the length to be read.\n3. Write your request in Ce que tu veux changer.\n4. Check the price shown, then tap 👑 Lancer.\n5. Follow the progress on the right, then download the result."},{"c":"aleph","t":"2. Aleph 2.0 ✅","r":6,"x":"6. Prompt examples\n- \"Remove the logo at the bottom right, keep everything else identical.\"\n- \"Replace the setting with a beach at sunset; the dancers, their moves and the framing stay identical.\""},{"c":"aleph","t":"2. Aleph 2.0 ✅","r":7,"x":"7. Durations, resolutions and limits. Up to 5 s or up to 10 s on the client side. The Studio area works up to 30 s and 200 MB."},{"c":"aleph","t":"2. Aleph 2.0 ✅","r":8,"x":"8. Costs (verified). Up to 5 s: 3,499 FCFA · up to 10 s: 5,499 FCFA."},{"c":"aleph","t":"2. Aleph 2.0 ✅","r":9,"x":"9. Download and results. An edited video, to download from the Result panel (⬇️ Télécharger — Download)."},{"c":"aleph","t":"2. Aleph 2.0 ✅","r":10,"x":"10. Troubleshooting\n Problem Solution \n --- --- \n Video too long Trim it to 10 s maximum. \n Moderation refusal Change video or rephrase; a refusal during creation is not refunded. \n The result changes too much State what must stay identical (people, moves, framing)."},{"c":"aleph","t":"2. Aleph 2.0 ✅","r":11,"x":"11. Pro tips. One change at a time. Always say what must stay identical. For several changes, run Aleph again on the previous result."},{"c":"aleph","t":"2. Aleph 2.0 ✅","r":12,"x":"12. Help. Tap 💬 Talk to Naya; if you prefer to delegate, ask Studio Rudis for a quote."},{"c":"seedance25","t":"3. Seedance 2.5 Studio ✅ (5 and 10 s) · 🛠️ (long options)","r":0,"x":""},{"c":"seedance25","t":"3. Seedance 2.5 Studio ✅ (5 and 10 s) · 🛠️ (long options)","r":1,"x":"1. Overview and purpose. StarClip's high-end video, from your photo. Accepts real faces. Ideal for a performance video where the artist must be recognised."},{"c":"seedance25","t":"3. Seedance 2.5 Studio ✅ (5 and 10 s) · 🛠️ (long options)","r":2,"x":"2. Access. 👑 tab → ✨ Seedance 2.5 tile. In the Studio area 🛠️: SEEDANCE 2.5 · STUDIO card."},{"c":"seedance25","t":"3. Seedance 2.5 Studio ✅ (5 and 10 s) · 🛠️ (long options)","r":3,"x":"3. Buttons and fields 📸\n*Client side (Premium tile):*\n Element Role \n --- --- \n Chips 5 s · 6 499 FCFA / 10 s · 12 499 FCFA Duration (1080p). \n 📂 Choisir une photo (Choose a photo) Starting photo, required. \n Décris ta scène (Describe your scene) Action, emotion, camera. \n Start « Choisis d'abord une photo », « Décris ta scène », then « 👑 Lancer — price ». \n\n*Studio area 🛠️ (page « ✨ SEEDANCE 2.5 — CRÉER / RECRÉER »):* Ⓜ️ Quel moteur Seedance ? (which engine: 2.5 or 2.0) · ⓪ Que veux-tu faire ? (what do you want to do: 📸 PHOTO → VIDÉO or 🎬 VIDÉO + RÉFÉRENCES → VIDÉO) · ① Tes références (your references: 🖼️ Ajouter une image de référence, 📂 Importer la vidéo de départ, 🎬 Ajouter une vidéo de référence, 🎵 Ajouter un audio de référence, start second of the excerpt) · ② La scène à créer (the scene) · ③ Format et durée (quality 480p / 720p / 1080p, image format, duration 4 to 30 s, 🎤 Générer l'audio (chant et lip-sync) — generate audio, singing and lip-sync) · ④ C'est parti (go) · 🔎 Journal technique (technical log)."},{"c":"seedance25","t":"3. Seedance 2.5 Studio ✅ (5 and 10 s) · 🛠️ (long options)","r":4,"x":"4. Accepted files. Client side: one image (sharp photo, well-lit face). Studio: up to 30 reference images (free, 200 MB per file), a starting video and up to 9 reference videos (30 s in total, charged per second), up to 10 reference audios (30 s in total, free)."},{"c":"seedance25","t":"3. Seedance 2.5 Studio ✅ (5 and 10 s) · 🛠️ (long options)","r":5,"x":"5. Tutorial\n1. Choose the duration.\n2. Tap 📂 Choisir une photo.\n3. Describe the action, emotion and camera movement, without redescribing the setting or outfit (they come from the photo).\n4. Check the price, then tap 👑 Lancer."},{"c":"seedance25","t":"3. Seedance 2.5 Studio ✅ (5 and 10 s) · 🛠️ (long options)","r":6,"x":"6. Prompt examples\n- \"I sing facing the camera on a terrace at sunset, the camera slowly moves closer.\"\n- \"He puts a hand on his heart, still singing, eyes full of emotion; slow dolly in.\"\n- Studio, with references: \"The singer from image 1, wearing the outfit from image 2, sings on the stage from image 3; medium shot then close-up.\""},{"c":"seedance25","t":"3. Seedance 2.5 Studio ✅ (5 and 10 s) · 🛠️ (long options)","r":7,"x":"7. Durations, resolutions and limits. Client side: 5 or 10 s, 1080p. Studio 🛠️: 4 to 30 s; 480p / 720p / 1080p; 6 formats (21:9, 16:9, 4:3, 1:1, 3:4, 9:16); prompt up to 15,000 characters. If the reference song is too long, the app automatically keeps what fits. These long options have no client price yet."},{"c":"seedance25","t":"3. Seedance 2.5 Studio ✅ (5 and 10 s) · 🛠️ (long options)","r":8,"x":"8. Costs (verified). 5 s: 6,499 FCFA · 10 s: 12,499 FCFA."},{"c":"seedance25","t":"3. Seedance 2.5 Studio ✅ (5 and 10 s) · 🛠️ (long options)","r":9,"x":"9. Download and results. 1080p video to download (⬇️ Télécharger). For a full music video, assemble several videos in CapCut with your song."},{"c":"seedance25","t":"3. Seedance 2.5 Studio ✅ (5 and 10 s) · 🛠️ (long options)","r":10,"x":"10. Troubleshooting\n Problem Solution \n --- --- \n Moderation refusal Sharp real photo; describe what the person does rather than making them \"talk\". A refusal during creation is not refunded. \n The face changes Use a photo where the face is large and well lit. \n The result ignores the text Shorten it; focus on action and camera."},{"c":"seedance25","t":"3. Seedance 2.5 Studio ✅ (5 and 10 s) · 🛠️ (long options)","r":11,"x":"11. Pro tips. Large face in the image, clear light, short text focused on action and camera. Perfect the image before the video."},{"c":"seedance25","t":"3. Seedance 2.5 Studio ✅ (5 and 10 s) · 🛠️ (long options)","r":12,"x":"12. Help. Naya helps you write your scene and can translate it into English; Studio Rudis can produce a complete music video."},{"c":"seedance2studio","t":"4. Seedance 2.0 Studio 🛠️","r":0,"x":""},{"c":"seedance2studio","t":"4. Seedance 2.0 Studio 🛠️","r":1,"x":"1. Overview and purpose. The previous generation of Seedance, run through the Studio: it accepts real faces. Useful when Moteur A refuses a face photo."},{"c":"seedance2studio","t":"4. Seedance 2.0 Studio 🛠️","r":2,"x":"2. Access. Today in the director's Studio area (SEEDANCE 2.0 · STUDIO card, which opens the Seedance page with engine 2.0 preselected). For clients: on request via Studio Rudis, until a client price is set."},{"c":"seedance2studio","t":"4. Seedance 2.0 Studio 🛠️","r":3,"x":"3. Buttons and fields. The same as the Studio's Seedance page (see chapter 3, section 3), with Ⓜ️ Quel moteur Seedance ? → Seedance 2.0."},{"c":"seedance2studio","t":"4. Seedance 2.0 Studio 🛠️","r":4,"x":"4. Accepted files. Up to 9 images, 3 videos and 3 reference audios; video and audio together: 15 s maximum."},{"c":"seedance2studio","t":"4. Seedance 2.0 Studio 🛠️","r":5,"x":"5. Tutorial (Studio area).\n1. Choose Seedance 2.0.\n2. Choose the mode (photo → video, or video + references).\n3. Add your references.\n4. Describe the scene.\n5. Set quality, format and duration.\n6. Start."},{"c":"seedance2studio","t":"4. Seedance 2.0 Studio 🛠️","r":6,"x":"6. Prompt examples. \"The man in the black hat sings, mouth open; the others stay silent, lips closed.\" · \"He puts a hand on his heart, the camera slowly moves closer.\""},{"c":"seedance2studio","t":"4. Seedance 2.0 Studio 🛠️","r":7,"x":"7. Durations, resolutions and limits. 4 to 15 s; 480p / 720p / 1080p; 6 formats; shorter prompt than 2.5 (3,500 characters). Beyond the limit, the Studio proposes a ✍️ Prompt optimisé pour le Studio (optimised prompt) that you can reread, redo (🔄 Refaire l'optimisation) or compare with 📄 Voir mon texte d'origine (your original text)."},{"c":"seedance2studio","t":"4. Seedance 2.0 Studio 🛠️","r":8,"x":"8. Costs. Client price not set. Available on quote via Studio Rudis."},{"c":"seedance2studio","t":"4. Seedance 2.0 Studio 🛠️","r":9,"x":"9. Download and results. Video to download from the page."},{"c":"seedance2studio","t":"4. Seedance 2.0 Studio 🛠️","r":10,"x":"10. Troubleshooting. If 2.0 refuses, try 2.5 (more references, longer prompt)."},{"c":"seedance2studio","t":"4. Seedance 2.0 Studio 🛠️","r":11,"x":"11. Pro tips. Identify the singer by outfit or position, and state that the others do not sing."},{"c":"seedance2studio","t":"4. Seedance 2.0 Studio 🛠️","r":12,"x":"12. Help. Naya and Studio Rudis."},{"c":"seedance2","t":"5. Seedance 2.0 Moteur A ✅","r":0,"x":""},{"c":"seedance2","t":"5. Seedance 2.0 Moteur A ✅","r":1,"x":"1. Overview and purpose. A video from a photo or from text alone. ⚠️ Refuses photos of real faces: for yourself, use Seedance 2.5. Ideal for settings, moods and cutaway shots."},{"c":"seedance2","t":"5. Seedance 2.0 Moteur A ✅","r":2,"x":"2. Access. 👑 tab → 🌱 Seedance 2.0 tile."},{"c":"seedance2","t":"5. Seedance 2.0 Moteur A ✅","r":3,"x":"3. Buttons and fields 📸\n Element Role \n --- --- \n Chips 5 s · 3 499 / 10 s · 5 499 / 15 s · 8 499 FCFA Duration. \n 📂 Photo de départ (optionnel) (Starting photo, optional) Optional starting image. \n Décris ta scène (Describe your scene) Your text (at least 5 characters to start). \n Start « Décris ta scène », then « 👑 Lancer — price »."},{"c":"seedance2","t":"5. Seedance 2.0 Moteur A ✅","r":4,"x":"4. Accepted files. One image (optional), without a recognisable real face."},{"c":"seedance2","t":"5. Seedance 2.0 Moteur A ✅","r":5,"x":"5. Tutorial\n1. Choose the duration.\n2. Add a photo if you want.\n3. Describe the scene.\n4. Tap 👑 Lancer."},{"c":"seedance2","t":"5. Seedance 2.0 Moteur A ✅","r":6,"x":"6. Prompt examples. \"A Douala rooftop at night, city lights, the camera slowly moves forward.\" · \"Dancers in wax-print outfits on a lively square, wide shot then close-up.\""},{"c":"seedance2","t":"5. Seedance 2.0 Moteur A ✅","r":7,"x":"7. Durations, resolutions and limits. 5, 10 or 15 s; 720p enforced on the client side."},{"c":"seedance2","t":"5. Seedance 2.0 Moteur A ✅","r":8,"x":"8. Costs (verified). 3,499 / 5,499 / 8,499 FCFA."},{"c":"seedance2","t":"5. Seedance 2.0 Moteur A ✅","r":9,"x":"9. Download and results. Video to download (⬇️ Télécharger)."},{"c":"seedance2","t":"5. Seedance 2.0 Moteur A ✅","r":10,"x":"10. Troubleshooting. Face photo refused: switch to Seedance 2.5. If there is a technical failure, your balance is refunded automatically."},{"c":"seedance2","t":"5. Seedance 2.0 Moteur A ✅","r":11,"x":"11. Pro tips. Describe a place, a light and a precise camera movement; avoid close-up faces."},{"c":"seedance2","t":"5. Seedance 2.0 Moteur A ✅","r":12,"x":"12. Help. Naya corrects your text and warns you if a real face is likely to be refused."},{"c":"chanson","t":"6. Créer une chanson (Create a song) ✅","r":0,"x":""},{"c":"chanson","t":"6. Créer une chanson (Create a song) ✅","r":1,"x":"1. Overview and purpose. Describe the style, write (or have written) the lyrics: you get 2 versions of a complete song."},{"c":"chanson","t":"6. Créer une chanson (Create a song) ✅","r":2,"x":"2. Access. 👑 tab → 🎵 Chanson tile."},{"c":"chanson","t":"6. Créer une chanson (Create a song) ✅","r":3,"x":"3. Buttons and fields 📸\n Element Role \n --- --- \n Genre Afropop, Afrobeats, Amapiano, Makossa, Bikutsi, Coupé-décalé, Ndombolo, Congolese rumba, Highlife, African gospel, Afro R&B, Zouk/Kizomba, Afro-trap, Afro-dancehall, Afro-jazz, Ballad. \n Voix (Voice) Male, female, duet, with choir. \n Langue du chant (Singing language) French, English, both, Pidgin, Duala + French. \n Ambiance (Mood) Festive, romantic, spiritual, melancholic, motivational. \n 🎧 Copier le style d'une chanson (Copy a song's style) → 📂 Choisir la chanson modèle (Choose the model song) The AI describes the style (genre, tempo, instruments, intro, voice, mix); your song stays new. \n Tes précisions (optionnel, en français) (Your details, optional) E.g. \"for my wedding, very catchy chorus\". \n Paroles (Lyrics) Paste yours, or leave empty for the AI to write them. \n Start « Choisis un genre (ou décris ton style) » (choose a genre or describe your style), then « 👑 Lancer — 499 FCFA »."},{"c":"chanson","t":"6. Créer une chanson (Create a song) ✅","r":4,"x":"4. Accepted files. Optional: an audio file of a model song."},{"c":"chanson","t":"6. Créer une chanson (Create a song) ✅","r":5,"x":"5. Tutorial\n1. Choose the genre, voice, language and mood.\n2. Add your details.\n3. Paste the lyrics, with verses separated by a blank line, or leave empty.\n4. Tap 👑 Lancer."},{"c":"chanson","t":"6. Créer une chanson (Create a song) ✅","r":6,"x":"6. Prompt examples. \"Song for my wedding, very catchy chorus, soft guitar, a little saxophone.\" · \"Festive Makossa for a birthday, joyful choir.\""},{"c":"chanson","t":"6. Créer une chanson (Create a song) ✅","r":7,"x":"7. Durations and limits. Length decided by the engine; up to 3,500 characters of lyrics. Songs already released by others are refused."},{"c":"chanson","t":"6. Créer une chanson (Create a song) ✅","r":8,"x":"8. Cost (verified). 499 FCFA for the 2 versions."},{"c":"chanson","t":"6. Créer une chanson (Create a song) ✅","r":9,"x":"9. Download and results. Buttons ⬇️ Télécharger (Download) and 🎚️ Extraire les stems de cette chanson (Extract the stems of this song)."},{"c":"chanson","t":"6. Créer une chanson (Create a song) ✅","r":10,"x":"10. Troubleshooting. Wrong style: choose the genre from the chips. Copyright refusal: only use your own music."},{"c":"chanson","t":"6. Créer une chanson (Create a song) ✅","r":11,"x":"11. Pro tips. The repeated block of lyrics automatically becomes the chorus: no tags needed. The 🎛️ Producteur IA (AI Producer) turns your choices into a detailed studio instruction."},{"c":"chanson","t":"6. Créer une chanson (Create a song) ✅","r":12,"x":"12. Help. Naya checks your lyrics (separated verses); Studio Rudis can produce your song and music video."},{"c":"chansonPro","t":"7. Chanson Pro ✅","r":0,"x":""},{"c":"chansonPro","t":"7. Chanson Pro ✅","r":1,"x":"1. Overview and purpose. Our high-end engine, studio quality, 1 version, with a real WAV."},{"c":"chansonPro","t":"7. Chanson Pro ✅","r":2,"x":"2. Access. 👑 tab → ⭐ Chanson Pro — qualité studio tile."},{"c":"chansonPro","t":"7. Chanson Pro ✅","r":3,"x":"3. Buttons and fields. Those of « Créer une chanson » (genre, voice, language, mood, 🎧 Copier le style d'une chanson, details, lyrics), plus duration chips ≈ 2 min · 999, ≈ 3 min · 1 499, ≈ 3 min 50 · 1 999 FCFA."},{"c":"chansonPro","t":"7. Chanson Pro ✅","r":4,"x":"4. Accepted files. Optional: an audio file of a model song."},{"c":"chansonPro","t":"7. Chanson Pro ✅","r":5,"x":"5. Tutorial\n1. Choose the length.\n2. Choose genre, voice, language and mood.\n3. Add your details and lyrics.\n4. Tap 👑 Lancer."},{"c":"chansonPro","t":"7. Chanson Pro ✅","r":6,"x":"6. Prompt examples. \"Festive Afrobeats, female voice, chorus in Duala and French.\" · \"African gospel, powerful choir, gradual build-up.\""},{"c":"chansonPro","t":"7. Chanson Pro ✅","r":7,"x":"7. Durations and limits. ≈ 2 min (115 s), ≈ 3 min (175 s) or ≈ 3 min 50 (228 s); 1 version. Actual lengths are slightly shorter than the rounded labels, hence the « ≈ » shown in the app."},{"c":"chansonPro","t":"7. Chanson Pro ✅","r":8,"x":"8. Costs (verified). 999 / 1,499 / 1,999 FCFA."},{"c":"chansonPro","t":"7. Chanson Pro ✅","r":9,"x":"9. Download and results. ⬇️ Télécharger le WAV (studio quality), 🎧 Télécharger le MP3 rapide (quick MP3, to listen or share fast), 🎚️ Extraire les stems de cette chanson."},{"c":"chansonPro","t":"7. Chanson Pro ✅","r":10,"x":"10. Troubleshooting. If the call fails, your balance is refunded. Wrong style: choose the genre from the chips."},{"c":"chansonPro","t":"7. Chanson Pro ✅","r":11,"x":"11. Pro tips. Use 🎧 Copier le style d'une chanson to aim for a precise sound: only the style is taken, never the melody or lyrics."},{"c":"chansonPro","t":"7. Chanson Pro ✅","r":12,"x":"12. Help. Naya and Studio Rudis."},{"c":"miniseries","t":"8. Mini-séries Studio ✅","r":0,"x":""},{"c":"miniseries","t":"8. Mini-séries Studio ✅","r":1,"x":"1. Overview and purpose. Tell your idea: StarClip writes a 30 to 60-second pilot episode, split into 5 or 10-second scenes. You approve each step before any video is created, and each scene is started one at a time, with your confirmation."},{"c":"miniseries","t":"8. Mini-séries Studio ✅","r":2,"x":"2. Access. 🎞️ Mini-séries IA tab."},{"c":"miniseries","t":"8. Mini-séries Studio ✅","r":3,"x":"3. Steps and buttons 📸\n Step Buttons and fields \n --- --- \n Idea Ton idée (en français, quelques phrases) (your idea, a few sentences); duration slider from 30 to 60 s; Proposer un nouveau scénario (propose a new script). \n Characters (1 to 3) Role in English (e.g. \"the young nurse\"), description; ＋ Ajouter un personnage (add a character); ✓ Je valide ce personnage (approve this character). \n Settings (1 to 3) Place, time, light (in English), no people; ＋ Ajouter un décor (add a setting). \n References 📁 Importer une image (import an image) or 🎨 Créer par IA (create with AI); ✓ Valider les références (approve the references). \n Scenes Model, action, line; ＋ Ajouter une scène; ✓ Je valide le texte de cette scène (approve this scene's text); 🎬 Générer cette scène (generate this scene). \n Check ✓ Visages cohérents (faces consistent), Garder malgré tout (keep anyway), or mark \"to redo\" then 🔁 Regénérer cette scène (regenerate). \n Episode Assembler (assemble), ▶ Lire l'épisode (play), 📲 Enregistrer la scène, 📲 Enregistrer l'épisode (save). \n\nScene models: ⭐ Visage stable (Kling 3.0) (stable face), Pro (Kling 3.0 Turbo) (Pro packs only), Éco (Kling 2.1), 🎙️ Dialogues avec voix (dialogue with voice). Only the last one makes the characters speak their lines in French; with the others, lines remain notes."},{"c":"miniseries","t":"8. Mini-séries Studio ✅","r":4,"x":"4. Accepted files. Reference images for characters and settings. With 🎙️ Dialogues avec voix, the scene's starting image is required and the format follows the image's."},{"c":"miniseries","t":"8. Mini-séries Studio ✅","r":5,"x":"5. Tutorial\n1. Write your idea.\n2. Choose the duration.\n3. Have the script proposed.\n4. Approve characters and settings.\n5. Import or create the references, then approve them.\n6. For each scene: approve the text, then 🎬 Générer cette scène.\n7. Check face consistency.\n8. Assembler, ▶ Lire l'épisode, 📲 Enregistrer l'épisode."},{"c":"miniseries","t":"8. Mini-séries Studio ✅","r":6,"x":"6. Prompt examples. Idea: \"A young nurse discovers at night that her neighbour is hiding a secret…\" · Line: « On se retrouve ce soir au concert ! » (\"See you tonight at the concert!\")"},{"c":"miniseries","t":"8. Mini-séries Studio ✅","r":7,"x":"7. Durations and limits. 30 to 60-second episode; 5 or 10-second scenes; 1 to 3 characters and 1 to 3 settings. Faces are never perfectly identical from one scene to the next; French lip sync is not guaranteed. Your project is kept on your device."},{"c":"miniseries","t":"8. Mini-séries Studio ✅","r":8,"x":"8. Costs (verified, Dialogues avec voix). 5-second scene: 3,499 FCFA · 10-second scene: 5,499 FCFA, from your Premium balance. The other models use your pack's video credits."},{"c":"miniseries","t":"8. Mini-séries Studio ✅","r":9,"x":"9. Download and results. 📲 Enregistrer la scène or 📲 Enregistrer l'épisode. If assembly is not possible, download the scenes one by one."},{"c":"miniseries","t":"8. Mini-séries Studio ✅","r":10,"x":"10. Troubleshooting. « Ce modèle a besoin d'une image de départ pour la scène » (this model needs a starting image): add the image. « Il manque l'image du décor pour cette scène » (the setting image is missing): approve the setting references. Different faces: regenerate the scene or keep it anyway."},{"c":"miniseries","t":"8. Mini-séries Studio ✅","r":11,"x":"11. Pro tips. Sharp reference images (face from the front, well lit) help a lot. Check each scene before moving to the next. A Simulation sans frais (essai) (free simulation) lets you test the flow."},{"c":"miniseries","t":"8. Mini-séries Studio ✅","r":12,"x":"12. Help. Naya helps you write the lines; Studio Rudis can produce the whole series."},{"c":"montageAuto","t":"9. Montage Auto 🛠️","r":0,"x":""},{"c":"montageAuto","t":"9. Montage Auto 🛠️","r":1,"x":"1. Overview and purpose. You provide a song and a photo; StarClip proposes the whole edit: tempo, chorus, cuts on the strong beats, a text ready for each shot. The face in the photo is never regenerated."},{"c":"montageAuto","t":"9. Montage Auto 🛠️","r":2,"x":"2. Access. Today in the Studio area (🎼 MONTAGE AUTO card). Free opening to clients to be decided by the director."},{"c":"montageAuto","t":"9. Montage Auto 🛠️","r":3,"x":"3. Buttons and fields (Studio area) 📸\n Step Buttons and fields \n --- --- \n ① La chanson (the song) 🎵 Choisir la chanson (choose the song), Analyser la chanson (analyse the song). \n ② Le visage (the face) 🖼️ Choisir la photo (STARTING image of the shots where the face is visible); optional Autres angles (other angles: profile, three-quarter, back): ➕ Ajouter un angle, 8 maximum. \n ③ Le clip Tenues (outfits, one per line, described by the clothes); L'histoire du clip en français (the story, optional) + ✨ En tirer les décors et les actions (derive settings and actions); Décors and Actions (one per line, in English); Noms à interdire (names to forbid). \n Settings Étendue (scope: whole song or chorus only, chorus duration); Longueur des plans (shot length: ⏱️ Plans de 15 s or ✂️ Plans courts); Format de sortie (16:9, 9:16, 1:1); Résolution (480p test, 720p, 1080p). \n Edit Construire le montage (build the edit); 📋 Copier tous les textes (copy all texts); 📄 Exporter le minutage (CSV) (export the timing). \n ⑤ Générer les plans ▶️ Générer les 5 prochains plans (generate the next 5 shots); ⏹️ Arrêter après le plan en cours (stop after the current shot); Log."},{"c":"montageAuto","t":"9. Montage Auto 🛠️","r":4,"x":"4. Accepted files. A song (audio), a face photo, and up to 8 photos of other angles."},{"c":"montageAuto","t":"9. Montage Auto 🛠️","r":5,"x":"5. Tutorial\n1. Choose the song, then Analyser la chanson.\n2. Choose the photo (and other angles if you have them).\n3. Write the outfits, or the story then ✨ En tirer les décors et les actions.\n4. Set scope, shot length, format and resolution.\n5. Construire le montage.\n6. Reread the texts; copy them or export the timing.\n7. Generate the shots in batches of 5, checking each batch."},{"c":"montageAuto","t":"9. Montage Auto 🛠️","r":6,"x":"6. Examples. Story: \"A singer crosses Douala at night and finds his love on a rooftop.\" · Outfit: \"white suit, open black shirt\"."},{"c":"montageAuto","t":"9. Montage Auto 🛠️","r":7,"x":"7. Limits. The analysis runs in the browser: no credit is spent as long as you send nothing to the engine. The shots generated afterwards go through the video engines, which are paid. A text containing a \"name to forbid\" is never sent to the engine."},{"c":"montageAuto","t":"9. Montage Auto 🛠️","r":8,"x":"8. Costs. Analysis and edit: free. Shot generation: depends on the video engine used; client price not set for this workflow."},{"c":"montageAuto","t":"9. Montage Auto 🛠️","r":9,"x":"9. Using the results. Texts to copy, timing as CSV for your editing software, generated shots to download."},{"c":"montageAuto","t":"9. Montage Auto 🛠️","r":10,"x":"10. Troubleshooting. Nothing happens: first analyse the song and choose the photo, then tap « Construire le montage »."},{"c":"montageAuto","t":"9. Montage Auto 🛠️","r":11,"x":"11. Pro tips. Add 2 or 3 face angles so that shots where the head turns keep the same face. Generate batch by batch and stop if the result does not suit you."},{"c":"montageAuto","t":"9. Montage Auto 🛠️","r":12,"x":"12. Help. Naya explains each setting; Studio Rudis can produce the complete music video."},{"c":"multishot","t":"10. Multi-shot Video ✅","r":0,"x":""},{"c":"multishot","t":"10. Multi-shot Video ✅","r":1,"x":"1. Overview and purpose. A single text becomes a mini-video with several shots, ideal for a teaser."},{"c":"multishot","t":"10. Multi-shot Video ✅","r":2,"x":"2. Access. 👑 tab → 🎬 Multi-Shot Video tile. In the Studio area 🛠️: 🎬 MULTI-SHOT VIDEO page."},{"c":"multishot","t":"10. Multi-shot Video ✅","r":3,"x":"3. Buttons and fields. Client side: chips 5 s · 1 499, 10 s · 2 499, 15 s · 4 499 FCFA; 📂 Photo de départ (optionnel); Décris ta scène. Studio area: ⓪ Quel mode ? (Auto — 5 plans automatiques or Custom — j'écris chaque plan), ① Ton histoire (your story), ➕ Ajouter un plan (add a shot)."},{"c":"multishot","t":"10. Multi-shot Video ✅","r":4,"x":"4. Accepted files. One reference photo, optional."},{"c":"multishot","t":"10. Multi-shot Video ✅","r":5,"x":"5. Tutorial\n1. Choose the duration.\n2. Add a photo if you want.\n3. Write your story in one text, in the order of events.\n4. Tap 👑 Lancer."},{"c":"multishot","t":"10. Multi-shot Video ✅","r":6,"x":"6. Prompt examples. \"A singer arrives by car at a concert hall, walks on stage and greets the crowd.\""},{"c":"multishot","t":"10. Multi-shot Video ✅","r":7,"x":"7. Durations and limits. 5, 10 or 15 s. In Auto mode, the Studio splits the story into 5 shots (2,500 characters maximum). In Custom mode (Studio): 3 to 5 shots of 3 to 512 characters, whose durations add up exactly to the total duration."},{"c":"multishot","t":"10. Multi-shot Video ✅","r":8,"x":"8. Costs (verified). 1,499 / 2,499 / 4,499 FCFA."},{"c":"multishot","t":"10. Multi-shot Video ✅","r":9,"x":"9. Download and results. Video to download (⬇️ Télécharger)."},{"c":"multishot","t":"10. Multi-shot Video ✅","r":10,"x":"10. Troubleshooting. A refusal during creation is not refunded. If the shots are inconsistent, tell the events more simply, in order."},{"c":"multishot","t":"10. Multi-shot Video ✅","r":11,"x":"11. Pro tips. One shot, one action. State the place first, then the sequence."},{"c":"multishot","t":"10. Multi-shot Video ✅","r":12,"x":"12. Help. Naya and Studio Rudis."},{"c":"stems","t":"11. Stems ✅","r":0,"x":""},{"c":"stems","t":"11. Stems ✅","r":1,"x":"1. Overview and purpose. Splits a song into tracks: vocals, drums, bass, instruments. Useful for a remix, karaoke or lip-sync."},{"c":"stems","t":"11. Stems ✅","r":2,"x":"2. Access. 👑 tab → 🎚️ Extraire les stems tile, or the 🎚️ Extraire les stems de cette chanson button under a song you created."},{"c":"stems","t":"11. Stems ✅","r":3,"x":"3. Buttons and fields 📸\n Element Role \n --- --- \n 📂 Choisir un fichier audio (MP3, WAV…) (Choose an audio file) Your song. \n Nombre de pistes (Number of tracks) 4 pistes (vocals, drums, bass, other) or 6 pistes (+ guitar, piano). \n Format MP3, WAV (sans perte) (lossless) or MP3 + WAV. \n Start « Choisis d'abord ta chanson » (choose your song first), then « 👑 Lancer — 499 FCFA »."},{"c":"stems","t":"11. Stems ✅","r":4,"x":"4. Accepted files. An audio file (MP3, WAV…)."},{"c":"stems","t":"11. Stems ✅","r":5,"x":"5. Tutorial\n1. Choose your file, or use the button under a song you created.\n2. Choose 4 or 6 tracks.\n3. Choose the format.\n4. Tap 👑 Lancer.\n5. Download each track."},{"c":"stems","t":"11. Stems ✅","r":6,"x":"6. Usage examples. Isolate the vocals for a lip-sync; keep the instrumental for karaoke."},{"c":"stems","t":"11. Stems ✅","r":7,"x":"7. Limits. 4 or 6 tracks; MP3, WAV or both."},{"c":"stems","t":"11. Stems ✅","r":8,"x":"8. Cost (verified). 499 FCFA, whatever the format."},{"c":"stems","t":"11. Stems ✅","r":9,"x":"9. Download and results. One ⬇️ button per track and per format. Download quickly: links expire after a few days."},{"c":"stems","t":"11. Stems ✅","r":10,"x":"10. Troubleshooting. Start button inactive: choose your song first."},{"c":"stems","t":"11. Stems ✅","r":11,"x":"11. Pro tips. Only use music you hold the rights to. For a lip-sync, the vocals-only track gives much better articulation."},{"c":"stems","t":"11. Stems ✅","r":12,"x":"12. Help. Naya and Studio Rudis."},{"c":"demo","t":"12. Extra: Améliorer ma démo (Improve my demo) ✅","r":null,"x":"🎙️ Reprise (Cover): keeps your melody and lyrics and produces your demo studio-style (2 versions, 999 FCFA). ✨ Référence (Reference): creates a new song in the style of a 30-second excerpt of your demo (≈ 2 min 1,999, ≈ 3 min 2,999, ≈ 3 min 50 3,999 FCFA). Buttons: 📂 Choisir ta démo (MP3, WAV, M4A…); in Reference mode, Extrait de référence (30 s) — à partir de la seconde (reference excerpt, from second…; choose the most representative passage, often the chorus). Your own music only."},{"c":"rudis","t":"13. Studio Rudis — we do it for you","r":null,"x":"Don't want to use the tools yourself? Studio Rudis produces your music video from A to Z: script, AI video creation, professional editing, sync with your song, colour grading, titles and revisions. Delivered ready for YouTube, TV and social media.\n- Published offers: Clip Signature (2 to 3 min) 200,000 FCFA · Signature Plus 250,000 FCFA · Premium Cinéma from 300,000 FCFA. 50% deposit, 2 rounds of revisions included.\n- Ask for your quote on WhatsApp, or ask Naya."},{"c":"naya","t":"14. Naya, your assistant","r":null,"x":"Tap the ✦ Naya button at the bottom of the screen, from any tab. Naya:\n- explains every tab and every engine, step by step (Beginner level) or with settings and limits (Pro level);\n- gives you the price shown in the app before you start;\n- suggests a prompt for each music genre and can load it into Chanson Pro, without starting anything;\n- checks your prompt: write « check: » followed by your text;\n- explains errors and tells you honestly when a feature does not exist in StarClip;\n- prepares your quote request for Studio Rudis: you send it yourself on WhatsApp.\n\nNaya never starts anything for you and never touches your balance. She answers in writing in French, English or German (Spanish, Portuguese and Arabic will come later). The « 🔊 Listen » button reads the answer with Naya's voice (Mélanie). If it is not available, this is shown under the answer, which stays in writing. Your conversation stays on your device."},{"c":"projets","t":"15. Complete project examples","r":null,"x":"Project A — Performance video (artist)\n1. Sharp photo (waist-up shot).\n2. Seedance 2.5, 10 s: \"I sing facing the camera…\".\n3. Aleph to change the setting of one shot.\n4. Chanson Pro if you don't have a track yet.\n5. Edit in CapCut, or hand it to Studio Rudis.\n\nProject B — Release teaser (label)\n1. Multi-shot Video 15 s for the announcement.\n2. Stems to isolate the vocals of an excerpt.\n3. 9:16 versions for TikTok and Reels.\n\nProject C — Mini-series (creator)\n1. Idea in a few sentences.\n2. 2 characters and 2 settings approved, references imported.\n3. \"Dialogues avec voix\" scenes generated one by one.\n4. Assemble, then save the episode."},{"c":"faq","t":"16. FAQ","r":null,"x":"- Do I have to subscribe? No. You pay per use, from your topped-up balance.\n- When am I charged? When you tap 👑 Lancer, never before.\n- Will my face be respected? Use Seedance 2.5 (real faces accepted) and a sharp photo. Moteur A refuses real faces.\n- Why is a refusal not refunded? For Seedance 2.5, Aleph and Multi-Shot, the provider charges for work started. A refusal before it starts is not charged.\n- How long do you keep my files? Download your results quickly: some links expire after a few days. Mini-series projects are kept on your device.\n- Which language should I write my prompt in? In your own language; Naya can suggest an English translation, which you approve before using it."},{"c":"depannage","t":"17. If it doesn't work","r":null,"x":"The problem The solution \n --- --- \n « Refusé par la modération du fournisseur » (refused by the provider's moderation) Change the photo (sharp real photo) and rephrase without \"talking\". This refusal, before the start, costs you nothing. \n Premium balance too low Top up a Premium pack on WhatsApp. \n The result ignores my text Shorten it; describe the action, emotion and camera. \n My song's style is wrong Choose a genre from the chips. \n The face photo is refused (Moteur A) Use Seedance 2.5. \n The app seems stuck on an old version Reload it; on iPhone: Settings → Safari → Clear History and Website Data. \n A paid generation failed Your credits are refunded automatically (except a refusal during creation for Seedance 2.5, Aleph and Multi-Shot). \n\n# Part 2 — Every tab of the app\n\n> Taken from the code of the StarClip app v41.153 (read-only, 19 Oct 2026). Costs are given the way the app shows them to customers (credits on your code or pack prices). The exact price is always shown on the button before you launch. Screenshots 📸 still to be added. Admin-only features are grouped in chapter 30, without any technical detail or access code. Button labels are quoted as shown on screen (in French), with a translation."},{"c":"accueil","t":"18. 🎬 Home and your StarClip code","r":0,"x":""},{"c":"accueil","t":"18. 🎬 Home and your StarClip code","r":1,"x":"1. Overview. Home (Accueil) shows sample videos and the 🎟️ Ton code StarClip (your StarClip code) box. Your code unlocks the tools and holds your credits."},{"c":"accueil","t":"18. 🎬 Home and your StarClip code","r":2,"x":"2. Access. First tab of the top bar. Afterwards the app opens on the last tab you used, or on 📸 Ta photo (your photo) the first time."},{"c":"accueil","t":"18. 🎬 Home and your StarClip code","r":3,"x":"3. Buttons and settings. Sample thumbnails: tap one to open the video full size, with sound. Code field (example format: STAR-7K3M), then OK."},{"c":"accueil","t":"18. 🎬 Home and your StarClip code","r":4,"x":"4. Inputs and outputs. Input: your code. Nothing is created in this tab."},{"c":"accueil","t":"18. 🎬 Home and your StarClip code","r":5,"x":"5. Beginner tutorial\n1. Order your code (💳 Commander tab).\n2. Type it into Ton code StarClip, then tap OK.\n3. Go to 📸 Ta photo to start."},{"c":"accueil","t":"18. 🎬 Home and your StarClip code","r":6,"x":"6. Advanced use. Watch the samples before choosing a style: they show what the app can do."},{"c":"accueil","t":"18. 🎬 Home and your StarClip code","r":7,"x":"7. Limits and cost. Free. Without a code, paid tools stay locked."},{"c":"accueil","t":"18. 🎬 Home and your StarClip code","r":8,"x":"8. Common errors. Code refused: check letters and digits (no spaces), or ask on WhatsApp. Never share your code: it gives access to your credits."},{"c":"photo","t":"19. 📸 Your photo — starting photo, pose, retouch, face","r":0,"x":""},{"c":"photo","t":"19. 📸 Your photo — starting photo, pose, retouch, face","r":1,"x":"1. Overview. The starting point of your videos: your photo, reference photos of your face, and 3 correction tools (🕺 Changer la posture / change the pose, 🧹 Retoucher une image / retouch an image, 🎯 Recoller le vrai visage / restore the real face)."},{"c":"photo","t":"19. 📸 Your photo — starting photo, pose, retouch, face","r":2,"x":"2. Access. 📸 Ta photo tab (panel 1 Photo)."},{"c":"photo","t":"19. 📸 Your photo — starting photo, pose, retouch, face","r":3,"x":"3. Buttons and settings\n Element Role \n --- --- \n Choisir une photo (choose a photo) Your main photo (on a computer: drag and drop works). \n 👤 + Ajouter des photos de référence visage (add face reference photos) 1 to 3 sharp photos of your face: better likeness. \n 💑 Deuxième personne (second person) 1 to 3 photos of the 2nd person for a scene with two people. Without them, the AI invents their face. \n 📐 Format de l'image (image format) Original, 📱 9:16 Vertical, 🖥️ 16:9 Horizontal, ◻️ 1:1 Carré (square). The AI extends the real background, no blur. \n 🕺 Changer la posture New pose described in text; option 🎯 Recoller mon vrai visage après (restore my real face afterwards). \n 🧹 Retoucher une image Removes or adds one element (\"remove the man in the centre\", \"add rain\"); one-tap quick fixes. \n 🎯 Recoller le vrai visage Puts your real face back on a generated image, without touching the scene."},{"c":"photo","t":"19. 📸 Your photo — starting photo, pose, retouch, face","r":4,"x":"4. Inputs and outputs. Input: images (JPG, PNG…). Output: an image, reusable in the other tabs."},{"c":"photo","t":"19. 📸 Your photo — starting photo, pose, retouch, face","r":5,"x":"5. Beginner tutorial\n1. Tap Choisir une photo: sharp, facing the camera, well lit.\n2. Add 1 to 3 face reference photos.\n3. Choose the format of your future video (9:16 for TikTok and WhatsApp).\n4. If needed, fix the pose with 🕺 Changer la posture."},{"c":"photo","t":"19. 📸 Your photo — starting photo, pose, retouch, face","r":6,"x":"6. Advanced use and examples. Pose: \"standing in profile, one hand adjusting his jacket, looking at the lens\". Retouch: make one correction at a time and keep the previous image. Size corrections are the trickiest. Use 🎯 Recoller le vrai visage only if the face has changed."},{"c":"photo","t":"19. 📸 Your photo — starting photo, pose, retouch, face","r":7,"x":"7. Limits and cost. Changing the pose changes only the pose. People already in the photo never change during a retouch. Restoring the face costs 1 extra image and takes a few minutes. The cost is shown on the button."},{"c":"photo","t":"19. 📸 Your photo — starting photo, pose, retouch, face","r":8,"x":"8. Common errors. Greyed-out button \"Choisis d'abord une image\" (choose an image first): select an image. Distorted face in the source thumbnail: import your real original photo before restoring."},{"c":"traitement","t":"20. ✨ Effects — one-tap photo effects","r":0,"x":""},{"c":"traitement","t":"20. ✨ Effects — one-tap photo effects","r":1,"x":"1. Overview. Applies 1 to 3 ready-made effects to your photo without changing your face."},{"c":"traitement","t":"20. ✨ Effects — one-tap photo effects","r":2,"x":"2. Access. ✨ Traitement tab (panel Effets photo en un geste)."},{"c":"traitement","t":"20. ✨ Effects — one-tap photo effects","r":3,"x":"3. Buttons and settings. Left square: Ta photo (your photo); right square: Photo 2 (for /together and /transferoutfit). ⬅️ Mettre la photo du volet 1 à gauche (put the panel-1 photo on the left). Effects, for example: /4K (sharper photo), /together (bring two people together, with \"how are they?\" and \"where are they?\"), /albumcover (album cover). Optional Précision (detail) field."},{"c":"traitement","t":"20. ✨ Effects — one-tap photo effects","r":4,"x":"4. Inputs and outputs. Input: 1 or 2 images. Output: an image."},{"c":"traitement","t":"20. ✨ Effects — one-tap photo effects","r":5,"x":"5. Beginner tutorial\n1. Put your photo in the left square.\n2. Tap 1 to 3 effects.\n3. For /together, add the 2nd photo and describe the place.\n4. Launch."},{"c":"traitement","t":"20. ✨ Effects — one-tap photo effects","r":6,"x":"6. Advanced use. Apply effects before creating your video. Album cover: give the title in Précision. A free PDF guide explains every effect, with exercises."},{"c":"traitement","t":"20. ✨ Effects — one-tap photo effects","r":7,"x":"7. Limits and cost. 3 effects at most at a time. The cost is shown on the button."},{"c":"traitement","t":"20. ✨ Effects — one-tap photo effects","r":8,"x":"8. Common errors. Nothing happens: check that the photo is in the left square. For /together, the right square is required."},{"c":"look","t":"21. 👔 Outfit & scenery — outfit, setting, Image Studio","r":0,"x":""},{"c":"look","t":"21. 👔 Outfit & scenery — outfit, setting, Image Studio","r":1,"x":"1. Overview. Change your clothes (photo or video), the place behind you, or create a full image from text (🎨 Studio Images)."},{"c":"look","t":"21. 👔 Outfit & scenery — outfit, setting, Image Studio","r":2,"x":"2. Access. 👔 Habillage & Décor tab."},{"c":"look","t":"21. 👔 Outfit & scenery — outfit, setting, Image Studio","r":3,"x":"3. Buttons and settings\n Panel Elements \n --- --- \n 👔 Tenue — change les habits (outfit) Outfit description or outfit photo; Habiller qui ? (dress who: your photo, male model, female model); quality ⚡ Rapide (fast) or 💎 Pro; 👔 Transformer la tenue. \n 👔 Changer la tenue de ma vidéo (change my video's outfit) ① video (📂 Importer ma vidéo or 🕺 Ma dernière danse); ② outfit (🤵 evening suit, 🌍 wax print outfit, ✨ golden evening dress, 🎤 afrobeats star style, or free text); ③ launch. \n 🏛️ Décor royal (royal setting) 📂 Choisir l'image de référence (the app creates a setting in that spirit, not a copy) or a description; option Changer aussi la posture; option 🎯 Recoller mon vrai visage après. \n 🎨 Studio Images With your photo, with an imported photo, or ✨ Sans photo (invented scene); ready-made ideas; format 16:9, 9:16, 1:1."},{"c":"look","t":"21. 👔 Outfit & scenery — outfit, setting, Image Studio","r":4,"x":"4. Inputs and outputs. Images (JPG, PNG…); MP4, MOV or M4V videos of 10 s maximum for the video outfit. Output: an image or a video."},{"c":"look","t":"21. 👔 Outfit & scenery — outfit, setting, Image Studio","r":5,"x":"5. Beginner tutorial\n1. Outfit: describe it (\"blue and gold wax print shirt, fedora hat\"), then 👔 Transformer la tenue.\n2. Setting: import a mood image, then 🏛️ Transformer le décor.\n3. Do the outfit before the setting if you want both."},{"c":"look","t":"21. 👔 Outfit & scenery — outfit, setting, Image Studio","r":6,"x":"6. Advanced use and examples. Image Studio: \"an African dancer in a gold dress dancing in a nightclub\". For a real scene (seated at a table, surrounded by friends), use 🎬 Multi-plans instead (chapter 24). Video outfit: simple close-fitting clothes, good front light, steady phone, full body visible."},{"c":"look","t":"21. 👔 Outfit & scenery — outfit, setting, Image Studio","r":7,"x":"7. Limits and cost. Each tool changes one thing only (clothes or place). Video outfit: 1 video credit up to 5 s, 2 credits from 5 to 10 s; the original sound is not guaranteed. Image Studio: Pro packs only."},{"c":"look","t":"21. 👔 Outfit & scenery — outfit, setting, Image Studio","r":8,"x":"8. Common errors. Face slightly changed: use 🎯 Recoller le vrai visage. Image Studio locked: you need a Pro Pack. You are responsible for the videos and images you import."},{"c":"scenario","t":"22. 🎬 Video script — your video from text","r":0,"x":""},{"c":"scenario","t":"22. 🎬 Video script — your video from text","r":1,"x":"1. Overview. Describe your idea: the app turns it into a professional script and animates your photo."},{"c":"scenario","t":"22. 🎬 Video script — your video from text","r":2,"x":"2. Access. 🎬 Scénario tab (panel 2 Scénario du clip). The big gold Générer la vidéo (generate the video) button only appears in this tab and in Tout voir."},{"c":"scenario","t":"22. 🎬 Video script — your video from text","r":3,"x":"3. Buttons and settings\n Element Role \n --- --- \n ✨ Décris ton idée simplement (describe your idea) Your idea in French or English, turned into a script. \n Scénario professionnel (professional script) The final text, editable (English gives better results). \n 💃 Style de danse (dance style) Adds a full, editable dance description. \n 🎨 Créer le décor par IA (build the scene) First creates a full image of the scene with your face (private jet, villa, nightclub…). \n 🎯 Décor fidèle + 🔒 Pixel Lock Replaces only the background; with Pixel Lock, your person is kept pixel for pixel, with numeric verification. \n Qualité (quality) Éco, Pro (lip-sync), ⭐ Visage stable (stable face; needs at least 1 face reference photo). \n 🎤 Optimiser pour le chant (optimise for singing) Close shot, large face, no microphone in front of the mouth. Untick for wide dance shots. \n Durée (duration) 5 seconds or 10 seconds."},{"c":"scenario","t":"22. 🎬 Video script — your video from text","r":4,"x":"4. Inputs and outputs. Input: your photo (📸 tab) and your text. Output: a 5 or 10 s video."},{"c":"scenario","t":"22. 🎬 Video script — your video from text","r":5,"x":"5. Beginner tutorial\n1. Write your idea: \"I sing on the beach at sunset\".\n2. Tap the button that creates the script, then read it.\n3. Choose the quality and duration.\n4. Tap Générer la vidéo."},{"c":"scenario","t":"22. 🎬 Video script — your video from text","r":6,"x":"6. Advanced use and examples. \"The man sings passionately and dances to an afrobeats groove at sunset on a beach, smooth camera orbit, warm cinematic light.\" For believable singing: Optimiser pour le chant and a close shot. To keep your face identical: ⭐ Visage stable or 🔒 Pixel Lock."},{"c":"scenario","t":"22. 🎬 Video script — your video from text","r":7,"x":"7. Limits and cost. 5 or 10 s per video. The cost depends on quality and duration and is shown before launching."},{"c":"scenario","t":"22. 🎬 Video script — your video from text","r":8,"x":"8. Common errors. The create button stays grey: write your idea first. Visage stable needs at least 1 face reference photo. Result far from your text: shorten it, describe action, emotion and camera."},{"c":"danses","t":"23. 🕺 Dances and 🏙️ your video's background","r":0,"x":""},{"c":"danses","t":"23. 🕺 Dances and 🏙️ your video's background","r":1,"x":"1. Overview. 🕺 Danses: a real filmed dancer's movement is transferred onto your photo. 🏙️ Changer le décor de ma vidéo: keeps the person, movement, outfit and sound, and changes the background."},{"c":"danses","t":"23. 🕺 Dances and 🏙️ your video's background","r":2,"x":"2. Access. 🎬 Scénario tab."},{"c":"danses","t":"23. 🕺 Dances and 🏙️ your video's background","r":3,"x":"3. Buttons and settings. Dances: ① who dances (panel-1 photo or imported image); ② which dance, either A · 🎬 Danses StarClip (studio choreographies) or B · 📹 Ma propre danse (imported video); ③ launch. Video background: ① video (🕺 Ma dernière danse or import; 👉 Continuer tel quel / continue as is, or 👉 🔄 Convertir en 16:9); ② background, either A · 🎬 Décors StarClip, B · 🎨 Créer mon décor (text) or C · 📂 Importer mon image; ③ launch; copyable 🔎 Journal technique (technical log)."},{"c":"danses","t":"23. 🕺 Dances and 🏙️ your video's background","r":4,"x":"4. Inputs and outputs. MP4, MOV or M4V videos of 10 s maximum; JPG, PNG… images. Output: a vertical video with sound."},{"c":"danses","t":"23. 🕺 Dances and 🏙️ your video's background","r":5,"x":"5. Beginner tutorial\n1. Choose your photo.\n2. Choose one studio dance (A) or import your dance (B), not both.\n3. Tap the launch button of this panel, not the big gold button."},{"c":"danses","t":"23. 🕺 Dances and 🏙️ your video's background","r":6,"x":"6. Advanced use. Your own dance: one person only, full body visible, fixed camera. Created background: \"a New York avenue at night, neon lights, yellow cabs, wet street\"."},{"c":"danses","t":"23. 🕺 Dances and 🏙️ your video's background","r":7,"x":"7. Limits and cost. 1 video credit up to 5 s, 2 credits from 5 to 10 s; exact price on the button. Conversion to 16:9: 2 credits. Only use dances and images you have the right to use."},{"c":"danses","t":"23. 🕺 Dances and 🏙️ your video's background","r":8,"x":"8. Common errors. Nothing is created: you tapped the big gold button instead of the panel's button. Poor movement: the source video showed several people or a cut-off body."},{"c":"multiplans","t":"24. 🎬 Multi-shot 3.0 — your mini clip","r":0,"x":""},{"c":"multiplans","t":"24. 🎬 Multi-shot 3.0 — your mini clip","r":1,"x":"1. Overview. Chains 2 to 6 shots in one video (15 s maximum), with your face anchored to your reference photos."},{"c":"multiplans","t":"24. 🎬 Multi-shot 3.0 — your mini clip","r":2,"x":"2. Access. 🎬 Scénario tab, panel 🎬 Multi-plans 3.0."},{"c":"multiplans","t":"24. 🎬 Multi-shot 3.0 — your mini clip","r":3,"x":"3. Buttons and settings. One field per shot (French or English, formatted automatically), 💃 Style de danse pour tous les plans (dance style for all shots), ＋ Ajouter un plan (add a shot), launch."},{"c":"multiplans","t":"24. 🎬 Multi-shot 3.0 — your mini clip","r":4,"x":"4. Inputs and outputs. Input: your face reference photos (📸 tab) and one text per shot. Output: a video of 15 s at most."},{"c":"multiplans","t":"24. 🎬 Multi-shot 3.0 — your mini clip","r":5,"x":"5. Beginner tutorial\n1. Add at least 1 face reference photo.\n2. Write shot 1, then ＋ Ajouter un plan.\n3. Fill in 2 to 6 shots, then launch."},{"c":"multiplans","t":"24. 🎬 Multi-shot 3.0 — your mini clip","r":6,"x":"6. Advanced use and examples. Shot 1: \"arrives by car in front of the club\"; shot 2: \"greets the crowd\"; shot 3: \"dances with friends on the dance floor\". This is the tool for real scenes (at a table, with friends, in action)."},{"c":"multiplans","t":"24. 🎬 Multi-shot 3.0 — your mini clip","r":7,"x":"7. Limits and cost. 2 to 6 shots, 15 s in total. The cost is shown before launching."},{"c":"multiplans","t":"24. 🎬 Multi-shot 3.0 — your mini clip","r":8,"x":"8. Common errors. Button \"Complète les plans du mini-clip\" (complete your shots): one shot is empty."},{"c":"miniseriesClient","t":"25. 🎞️ AI mini-series — your pilot episode","r":0,"x":""},{"c":"miniseriesClient","t":"25. 🎞️ AI mini-series — your pilot episode","r":1,"x":"1. Overview. Tell your idea: StarClip writes a 30 to 60-second pilot episode, split into scenes of 5 or 10 seconds."},{"c":"miniseriesClient","t":"25. 🎞️ AI mini-series — your pilot episode","r":2,"x":"2. Access. 🎞️ Mini-séries IA tab. Advanced Studio version: chapter 8."},{"c":"miniseriesClient","t":"25. 🎞️ AI mini-series — your pilot episode","r":3,"x":"3. Buttons and settings. Your idea, your reference images, then approval of each step. Each scene is launched one by one, with your confirmation."},{"c":"miniseriesClient","t":"25. 🎞️ AI mini-series — your pilot episode","r":4,"x":"4. Inputs and outputs. Sharp reference images. Output: the episode's scenes. The project is kept on your device."},{"c":"miniseriesClient","t":"25. 🎞️ AI mini-series — your pilot episode","r":5,"x":"5. Beginner tutorial\n1. Tell your idea in a few sentences.\n2. Approve the proposed breakdown.\n3. Add sharp reference images.\n4. Launch the scenes one by one and check each one."},{"c":"miniseriesClient","t":"25. 🎞️ AI mini-series — your pilot episode","r":6,"x":"6. Advanced use. Keep the same reference images from one scene to the next."},{"c":"miniseriesClient","t":"25. 🎞️ AI mini-series — your pilot episode","r":7,"x":"7. Limits and cost. Faces are never perfectly identical from one scene to the next. No video is created before your approval; each scene's cost is shown before it is launched."},{"c":"miniseriesClient","t":"25. 🎞️ AI mini-series — your pilot episode","r":8,"x":"8. Common errors. Project not found on another device: it is saved on the device where you created it."},{"c":"finition","t":"26. 🎤 Finishing — lip-sync and format","r":0,"x":""},{"c":"finition","t":"26. 🎤 Finishing — lip-sync and format","r":1,"x":"1. Overview. Lip-sync: make your video sing your song. 🔄 Changer le format d'une vidéo (change a video's format): vertical, horizontal or square, without black bars."},{"c":"finition","t":"26. 🎤 Finishing — lip-sync and format","r":2,"x":"2. Access. 🎤 Finition tab (panel 3 Lip-sync)."},{"c":"finition","t":"26. 🎤 Finishing — lip-sync and format","r":3,"x":"3. Buttons and settings\n Element Role \n --- --- \n Dernière vidéo générée / 📂 Importer une vidéo The source video (last generated or imported). \n Choisir l'audio (choose the audio) Excerpt of your song (any audio format). \n 🔍 Détection auto du départ / 🎯 Le chant commence ICI (pro) Aligns the excerpt with the start of the voice. \n 🎚️ Réglage fin (ms) then Couper Fine timing adjustment. \n Qualité du chant (singing quality) Standard — inclus (included) or ⭐ Pro — lèvres naturelles (natural lips). \n 🎤 Isoler la voix avant le lip-sync First removes the instruments, then puts the full song back (recommended). \n Nouveau format (new format) 📱 9:16, 🖥️ 16:9, ◻️ 1:1."},{"c":"finition","t":"26. 🎤 Finishing — lip-sync and format","r":4,"x":"4. Inputs and outputs. MP4 or MOV video of 2 to 10 s in Standard (longer in Pro), 30 MB maximum; audio in any format. Output: a singing video with your song."},{"c":"finition","t":"26. 🎤 Finishing — lip-sync and format","r":5,"x":"5. Beginner tutorial\n1. Choose the source video.\n2. Choose the audio, then tap 🎯 Le chant commence ICI exactly when the voice starts.\n3. Keep Isoler la voix ticked.\n4. Choose the quality, then launch."},{"c":"finition","t":"26. 🎤 Finishing — lip-sync and format","r":6,"x":"6. Advanced use. The larger the face on screen, the more naturally the mouth moves: close shots for singing, wide shots for dancing, then assemble both in your editing software."},{"c":"finition","t":"26. 🎤 Finishing — lip-sync and format","r":7,"x":"7. Limits and cost. Standard: included. ⭐ Pro: uses 1 video from your code. Isolating the voice adds about 30 s."},{"c":"finition","t":"26. 🎤 Finishing — lip-sync and format","r":8,"x":"8. Common errors. Lips out of sync: redo the alignment with 🎯 or the fine adjustment. Little mouth movement: the face is too small on screen. Untick Isoler la voix if your audio is already a voice alone."},{"c":"commander","t":"27. 💳 Order — packs and Clip Signature","r":0,"x":""},{"c":"commander","t":"27. 💳 Order — packs and Clip Signature","r":1,"x":"1. Overview. Buy your StarClip code with Orange Money or MTN Mobile Money, no bank card needed, or order a video made by the studio."},{"c":"commander","t":"27. 💳 Order — packs and Clip Signature","r":2,"x":"2. Access. 💳 Commander tab."},{"c":"commander","t":"27. 💳 Order — packs and Clip Signature","r":3,"x":"3. Packs (AI video scenes to edit yourself). ⭐ Essai Star, 1 Éco scene: 1,500 FCFA · 🎟️ Pack Social, 5 Éco scenes: 6,000 FCFA · 🎟️ Pack Créateur, 10 Éco scenes: 10,000 FCFA · 💠 Pack Pro, 5 Pro scenes up to 10 s: 15,000 FCFA · 💠 Pack Pro Plus, 10 Pro scenes: 25,000 FCFA. Pro packs also unlock the Image Studio."},{"c":"commander","t":"27. 💳 Order — packs and Clip Signature","r":4,"x":"4. Clip Signature (made by a professional). 🎬 Clip Signature, 2 to 3 minutes: 200,000 FCFA · 🎬 Clip Signature Plus, more scenes and 2 formats: 250,000 FCFA · 👑 Clip Premium Cinéma: from 300,000 FCFA. 50% deposit, 2 rounds of revisions included."},{"c":"commander","t":"27. 💳 Order — packs and Clip Signature","r":5,"x":"5. Beginner tutorial\n1. Send the amount to the number shown in the Commander tab (Copier button).\n2. Send the proof of payment on WhatsApp (💬 Commander sur WhatsApp).\n3. Receive your code on WhatsApp, then enter it at the top of the app."},{"c":"commander","t":"27. 💳 Order — packs and Clip Signature","r":6,"x":"6. Advanced use. Packs give separate scenes to assemble yourself with your song. For a complete, edited and synced music video, choose Clip Signature (Studio Rudis)."},{"c":"commander","t":"27. 💳 Order — packs and Clip Signature","r":7,"x":"7. Limits. Mobile payment and WhatsApp. The payment numbers are only those shown in the app: accept no other."},{"c":"commander","t":"27. 💳 Order — packs and Clip Signature","r":8,"x":"8. Common errors. Code not yet received: it arrives on WhatsApp within minutes, after the payment is checked."},{"c":"ressources","t":"28. 📝 Prompts, 💡 Ideas and 📜 See all","r":0,"x":""},{"c":"ressources","t":"28. 📝 Prompts, 💡 Ideas and 📜 See all","r":1,"x":"1. Overview. 📝 Prompts: ready-to-use texts in French and English. 💡 Idées (ideas): descriptions that work well for a dance or singing scene. 📜 Tout voir (see all): every panel in a row, numbered in the recommended order."},{"c":"ressources","t":"28. 📝 Prompts, 💡 Ideas and 📜 See all","r":2,"x":"2. Access. 📝 Prompts, 💡 Idées, 📜 Tout voir tabs."},{"c":"ressources","t":"28. 📝 Prompts, 💡 Ideas and 📜 See all","r":3,"x":"3. Buttons and settings. Prompts: 🇫🇷 Français / 🇬🇧 English. Ideas: copy an example, then change a few words."},{"c":"ressources","t":"28. 📝 Prompts, 💡 Ideas and 📜 See all","r":4,"x":"4. Inputs and outputs. Text to copy into another tab."},{"c":"ressources","t":"28. 📝 Prompts, 💡 Ideas and 📜 See all","r":5,"x":"5. Beginner tutorial\n1. Open 💡 Idées.\n2. Copy a description.\n3. Paste it into 🎬 Scénario and change the clothes, music style or number of dancers."},{"c":"ressources","t":"28. 📝 Prompts, 💡 Ideas and 📜 See all","r":6,"x":"6. Advanced use. Always describe clothes and mood, never a person's name. Write in English if you can."},{"c":"ressources","t":"28. 📝 Prompts, 💡 Ideas and 📜 See all","r":7,"x":"7. Limits and cost. Free."},{"c":"ressources","t":"28. 📝 Prompts, 💡 Ideas and 📜 See all","r":8,"x":"8. Common errors. Result ignores your text: text too long or a proper name; describe what is seen instead."},{"c":"remix","t":"29. 🔁 Remix (preview)","r":0,"x":""},{"c":"remix","t":"29. 🔁 Remix (preview)","r":1,"x":"1. Overview. Preview of the upcoming Remix tool: take a scene and tell what happens next (characters, interaction, trigger)."},{"c":"remix","t":"29. 🔁 Remix (preview)","r":2,"x":"2. Access. 🔁 Remix tab, visible only when enabled."},{"c":"remix","t":"29. 🔁 Remix (preview)","r":3,"x":"3. Buttons and settings. Modèle (template) or Personnaliser (customise); #Remix Rapide (one sentence), choice of characters and interaction, 🔀 Aléatoire (random); 🎬 Remixer maintenant."},{"c":"remix","t":"29. 🔁 Remix (preview)","r":4,"x":"4. Inputs and outputs. A source scene and a text."},{"c":"remix","t":"29. 🔁 Remix (preview)","r":5,"x":"5. Beginner tutorial. In preview: you can explore the screen, but no video is created yet."},{"c":"remix","t":"29. 🔁 Remix (preview)","r":6,"x":"6. Advanced use. Available once generation opens (step 3)."},{"c":"remix","t":"29. 🔁 Remix (preview)","r":7,"x":"7. Limits and cost. Design preview: nothing is charged. The cost shown on screen (2 credits) will apply when it opens."},{"c":"remix","t":"29. 🔁 Remix (preview)","r":8,"x":"8. Common errors. Tab missing: Remix is not enabled on your app yet."},{"c":"fonctionsReservees","t":"30. 🛠️ Admin-only features (for information)","r":0,"x":""},{"c":"fonctionsReservees","t":"30. 🛠️ Admin-only features (for information)","r":1,"x":"1. Overview. Some features are for the studio only and are not available to customers: the Studio space (long or advanced versions of Seedance, Aleph, Multi-Shot, Montage Auto, Mini-series, songs and stems), creating customer codes, Premium top-ups and changing plans."},{"c":"fonctionsReservees","t":"30. 🛠️ Admin-only features (for information)","r":2,"x":"2. Access. Protected access, studio only. No access code is published in this manual."},{"c":"fonctionsReservees","t":"30. 🛠️ Admin-only features (for information)","r":3,"x":"3. Markers. In chapters 2 to 12, the 🛠️ sign marks an option that currently exists only in the Studio space."},{"c":"fonctionsReservees","t":"30. 🛠️ Admin-only features (for information)","r":4,"x":"4. Inputs and outputs. Not applicable to customers."},{"c":"fonctionsReservees","t":"30. 🛠️ Admin-only features (for information)","r":5,"x":"5. For customers. If you need a Studio feature, ask Studio Rudis to produce your project."},{"c":"fonctionsReservees","t":"30. 🛠️ Admin-only features (for information)","r":6,"x":"6. For Naya. Naya never gives access, codes or technical details about these features. She suggests Studio Rudis."},{"c":"fonctionsReservees","t":"30. 🛠️ Admin-only features (for information)","r":7,"x":"7. Limits. Customers can neither create codes nor change a balance."},{"c":"fonctionsReservees","t":"30. 🛠️ Admin-only features (for information)","r":8,"x":"8. Security. Never share your customer code, and only trust the payment numbers shown in the app."}],"absentes":[{"id":"prores","motif":"prores|apple prores|\\.mov (pro|master)","texte":"StarClip does not export to ProRes: your videos are delivered as MP4. For TV or cinema delivery, Studio Rudis can handle it."},{"id":"hdr","motif":"\\bhdr\\b|dolby vision","texte":"StarClip does not offer HDR video."},{"id":"doublage","motif":"doubl(age|er)|dubb(ing|en)|synchronisation in|traduire (la|ma) (voix|vidéo|video)|translate (the |my )?(voice|video)|video übersetzen","texte":"StarClip does not offer dubbing into another language. You can, however, create a song or a scene directly in the language you want."},{"id":"fps60","motif":"60 ?(fps|i/s|images par seconde|bilder pro sekunde)","texte":"StarClip does not offer a 60 fps setting."},{"id":"carte","motif":"carte (bancaire|de crédit|visa)|credit card|debit card|kreditkarte|bankkarte|paypal","texte":"Card payment is not available yet: you pay with Orange Money or MTN Mobile Money, as shown in the 💳 Commander tab."},{"id":"edition_section","motif":"(modifier|remplacer|changer) (seulement |juste )?(un|le|ce) (couplet|refrain)|(edit|replace) (only )?(a|one|the) (verse|chorus)|(strophe|refrain) (ändern|ersetzen)","texte":"StarClip cannot edit a single verse of a song already created: you need to create a new version."}],"outils":[{"id":"aleph","icone":"🎞️","nom":"Aleph 2.0","etat":"ouvert","imports":["video"],"champ":"What you want to change","exemple":"Remove the logo at the bottom right, keep everything else identical","etapes":["Tap « 📂 Choose the video to edit » and pick your video (10 s maximum).","The app reads your video's length and shows the matching price.","Write what you want to change (setting, element to remove), keeping everything else.","Check the price, then start."],"a_savoir":"Your video, its dance, framing and people stay; only what you describe changes. A video longer than 10 s must be trimmed first. A refusal by the engine during creation is not refunded."},{"id":"seedance25","icone":"✨","nom":"Seedance 2.5 Studio","etat":"ouvert","imports":["image"],"champ":"Describe your scene","exemple":"I sing facing the camera on a terrace at sunset","etapes":["Choose a sharp photo of yourself (a real photo, well-lit face).","Choose the length: 5 s or 10 s (1080p).","Describe the action, emotion and camera, not the setting or outfit already in the photo.","Check the price, then start."],"a_savoir":"Accepts real faces. Lengths from 4 to 30 s and 480p / 720p exist in the studio space but have no client price yet. A refusal by the engine during creation is not refunded."},{"id":"seedance2studio","icone":"🌟","nom":"Seedance 2.0 Studio","etat":"prix_a_fixer","imports":["image"],"champ":"Describe your scene","exemple":"He sings, one hand on his heart, the camera slowly moves closer","etapes":["This tool has no client price yet: it is offered through Studio Rudis.","Useful when Moteur A refuses a face photo."],"a_savoir":"Same Seedance 2.0, through the Studio: real faces are accepted. 15 s maximum, shorter prompt."},{"id":"seedance2","icone":"🌱","nom":"Seedance 2.0 Moteur A","etat":"ouvert","imports":["image (facultative)"],"champ":"Describe your scene","exemple":"A Douala rooftop at night, city lights, the camera slowly moves forward","etapes":["Add a starting photo if you want (optional), or just write a text.","Choose 5, 10 or 15 s.","Describe your scene.","Check the price, then start."],"a_savoir":"⚠️ Refuses photos of real faces: for a real photo of yourself, use Seedance 2.5 Studio. If there is a technical failure, your balance is refunded."},{"id":"chanson","icone":"🎵","nom":"Create a song","etat":"ouvert","imports":["audio (facultatif : chanson modèle pour copier le style)"],"champ":"Your details (optional)","exemple":"Song for my wedding, very catchy chorus, soft guitar, a little saxophone","etapes":["Choose the genre, voice, singing language and mood.","Add your details if you want.","Paste your lyrics with a blank line between verses, or leave empty and the AI writes them.","Start: you get 2 versions."],"a_savoir":"The repeated block automatically becomes the chorus. Pick a genre from the chips rather than typing it. Songs already released by others are refused."},{"id":"chansonPro","icone":"⭐","nom":"Chanson Pro","etat":"ouvert","imports":["audio (facultatif : chanson modèle pour copier le style)"],"champ":"Your details (optional)","exemple":"Festive Afrobeats, female voice, chorus in Duala and French","etapes":["Choose the length: 2 min, 3 min or 3 min 50.","Choose genre, voice, language and mood.","Add your lyrics or let the AI write them.","Start: you get 1 studio-quality version."],"a_savoir":"« 🎧 Copy a song's style »: the AI takes the style of a song you like, never its melody or lyrics."},{"id":"miniseries","icone":"🎞️","nom":"Mini-séries Studio","etat":"ouvert","imports":["image de départ (obligatoire)"],"champ":"Line and action of the scene","exemple":"She smiles at the camera and says: \"See you tonight at the concert!\"","etapes":["Open the 🎞️ AI Mini-series tab.","Choose « 🎙️ Dialogues with voice » for a scene where the character speaks.","Add the scene's starting image (required).","Write the line, check the price, then start the scene."],"a_savoir":"Characters speak their lines in French; price in FCFA from your Premium balance. Without « Dialogues with voice », the lines stay as notes."},{"id":"montageAuto","icone":"🎼","nom":"Auto Edit","etat":"gratuit_a_autoriser","imports":["photo","chanson"],"champ":"—","exemple":"","etapes":["Provide a photo and your song.","StarClip analyses tempo and chorus, cuts on the strong beats and prepares a text for each shot.","Shots are then generated with the video engines (paid)."],"a_savoir":"The analysis runs on your device: no credit spent. The photo's face is never regenerated. Opening to clients to be authorised by the director."},{"id":"multishot","icone":"🎬","nom":"Multi-shot Video","etat":"ouvert","imports":["photo de référence (facultative)"],"champ":"Describe your scene","exemple":"A singer arrives by car at a concert hall, walks on stage and greets the crowd","etapes":["Choose 5, 10 or 15 s.","Add a reference photo if you want (optional).","Write your story in a single text: the engine splits it into several shots.","Check the price, then start."],"a_savoir":"A refusal by the engine during creation is not refunded."},{"id":"stems","icone":"🎚️","nom":"Stems","etat":"ouvert","imports":["audio"],"champ":"—","exemple":"","etapes":["Choose an audio file, or tap « 🎚️ Extract stems » under a song you created.","Choose 4 tracks (vocals, drums, bass, other) or 6 tracks (+ guitar, piano).","Choose the format: MP3, WAV or both.","Start, then download your tracks quickly: links expire after a few days."],"a_savoir":"Only use music you hold the rights to."}],"erreurs":[{"motif":"modération|moderation|refus|refused|content_policy","texte":"« Refused by the provider's moderation »: change the photo (a sharp real photo) and rephrase without making the person « talk ». If the refusal happens before it starts, your balance is not charged."},{"motif":"solde|balance|insuffisant|insufficient","texte":"Premium balance too low: top up a Premium pack on WhatsApp, or ask Studio Rudis to produce it for you."},{"motif":"visage|face|partner_validation","texte":"Moteur A refuses real face photos: use Seedance 2.5 Studio."},{"motif":"trop longue|too long|10 s|durée|duration","texte":"For Aleph, your video must be 10 s maximum: trim it, then try again."},{"motif":"ignore|ignored|texte|text","texte":"The result ignores your text: shorten it and describe the action, emotion and camera, not the setting or outfit."},{"motif":"style|genre","texte":"The song's style is wrong: pick a genre from the chips rather than typing it alone."},{"motif":"bloqu|vieille version|old version|recharge l'app|reload","texte":"The app seems stuck on an old version: reload it; on iPhone: Settings → Safari → Clear History and Website Data."},{"motif":"échou|failed|erreur technique|technical","texte":"If a paid generation fails for a technical reason, your credits are refunded automatically. (Exception: a refusal during creation is not refunded for Seedance 2.5, Aleph and Multi-Shot.)"},{"motif":"paiement.*(échou|refus|bloqu)|carte refusée|payment.*(fail|declin)|card declined|zahlung.*(fehl|abgelehnt)|karte abgelehnt","texte":"Payment not completed: nothing was credited. Check your account or card balance and try again; you can also pay by Orange Money or MTN Mobile Money. If you were charged but the order is not « paid », give me the order reference: it will be checked."}]};
